{
    "id":  11122,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Pack Digital SPI LED Controller RGB - RGBW - RGBIC - 5-24V + Remote Control",
    "reference":  "PACK-SPIR3-C6",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDigital SPI Controller Pack 2.4GHz (5-24V) + 2.4GHz remote control\u003c/strong\u003e, ideal for digital LED strips (RGB, RGBW or monochromatic). Control each LED individually, adjusting speed, brightness, direction, length, and dynamic modes. Save up to 4 custom scenes. Enjoy smart animations and customize colors and pixels for detailed effects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis pack is ideal for creative and professional lighting projects, supporting 20 editable dynamic modes and providing a stable, fast signal.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003ePack Digital SPI LED Controller RGB - RGBW - RGBIC - 5-24V + Remote Control\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 3-in-1 SPI LED Controller 2.4GHz pack with remote control - latest innovation in LED lighting control.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eKey Features:\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSPI Signal Transmission\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2.4G Wireless Remote Control:\u003c/strong\u003e 30m radius\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWide IC Compatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e Single color, RGB, RGBW\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Speed, brightness, direction, dynamic modes. 4 custom scenes\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Animations\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColor Customization and Pixel Control\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#2445a2;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis controller is ONLY compatible with 5m LED strip (1 roll).\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
